><span style="width:100%"><p>These stories introduce kids to freedom-based ideas like individual liberty, free-market economics, personal responsibility, critical thinking, entrepreneurship, and real-world history—wrapped up in fun, age-appropriate adventures.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="fc1b7211-fd70-4d08-8364-c28e9d1ff3f1" class="r-y9ol9y" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0cba5be6-e61e-4965-b46a-1cbbba7178c0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Reeb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-17opsfi"><div data-rid="68f2892f-aa10-460f-a6d8-54309be5209f" class="r-4y28ow alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are the activity workbooks downloadable or printed?</p></span></div><div data-rid="3fe772db-2b0c-4d48-997b-92092bd585c0" class="r-1hf0k7f" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1b6r00f" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Reeb2:"><div data-rid="f38ee3c5-2561-4641-bfb7-4cf356e9c893" class="r-1evrtil"><div data-rid="8bf60b33-731b-42b4-9f05-08ae02b350c5" class="r-tlm6xg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The activity workbooks are delivered as digital PDF files that you can download immediately after purchase. These printable companions to your physical books allow families to print as many copies as needed—perfect for multiple kids or reusing over time.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="3e216329-063f-4c9b-acee-d8419681eb35" class="r-17a25aj" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ea911938-cb0d-4872-9481-0870ac8bc73f" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rieb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1a8fpls"><div data-rid="2dda7d03-438e-4e40-89e2-bed16913755d" class="r-122758d alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is there a refund policy if it’s not the right fit?</p></span></div><div data-rid="e53471d1-bbab-4694-831f-12da6ad14db9" class="r-qwqhsc" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1bopn90" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rieb2:"><div data-rid="63b58691-f943-4216-8b1e-81c5d8146ce2" class="r-vg652i"><div data-rid="32d51cd2-2273-4316-9226-fc17389f1b65" class="r-ywsky3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes! The Tuttle Twins offer a 30-day, no-questions-asked refund policy. If you're not completely happy, just reach out, and you'll get your money back—risk-free.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><picture data-rid="1885c9df-599c-4e97-96d6-eae4f70dac32" class="r-m5t42"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/c64a97ac-2867-4b75-9190-6c5854c5e1fb?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/c64a97ac-2867-4b75-9190-6c5854c5e1fb?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/c64a97ac-2867-4b75-9190-6c5854c5e1fb?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/c64a97ac-2867-4b75-9190-6c5854c5e1fb" class="r-otrlm9" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div></div><